        "code": {
          "text": "Low back pain history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "10-day history of dull mid-to-lower lumbar pain, right greater than left, with a sharp twinge on flexion or lifting. Insidious onset without trauma or a single heavy lift. Worse at the end of the teaching day or when marking at a table; improved by lying flat and heat. A new firmer mattress about 3 weeks ago and increased gardening may have triggered it."
      }
